        "content": "Main Structure of the project\n\n1. Webhook for post request.\n\n2. Build AI agent that helps to provide answer of the question and also store them into memory (database). \n\n3. Webhook for respond .\n\n\nCapability to Add ( Tools )\n\n1. Web Search. --> Done \n2. Calendar Access.\n3. Gmail Access.\n4. Expense tracking.\n5. Note Creation.\n6. Task Creation and Task deletion.",
